      "order": 8,
      "type": "instruction",
      "title": "Inspect pump, hoses, and harness",
      "body": "Open the bulk drawer and remove the pump filter cap. Remove bulk drawer, front panel, and backer as needed. Verify pump, filter, drain hose, recirculation hose/nozzle, and pressure switch hose are free of obstructions. Check electrical connections at the drain and recirculation pumps.",
      "sourceExcerpt": "Open bulk drawer and remove pump filter cap. Verify that pump, pump filter, drain hose, recirculation hose/nozzle, and pressure switch hose are free from obstructions. Visually check the electrical connections at the Drain Pump and Recirculation Pumps.",
